=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">캠퍼스 에코리더</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">로 위촉하여 운영</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">   </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">확산방지 위해 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">온라인 위주 활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">전반기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">),</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">향후 점차적 오프라인 활동 확대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">생활속 거리두기 준수 철저</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">이와 관련하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">기 캠퍼스 에코리더</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">를 선발하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">  </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">관련 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">학생처 학생지원팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">054-478-7040)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\